7] [17592186124702 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186125456 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124702 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045463 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124702 #edb/ref 1045 "Level Curves" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124702 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186125326 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124702 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049882 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124702 #edb/ref 1050 660.0 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124702 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "97435fa2-2414-5733-b9c9-109a6d98298e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124888 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186323552 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124888 #edb/ref 1069 "q-35520" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124888 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124888 #edb/ref 1071 "Which of the following represents the level curves of $f(x,y)=\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124888 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f48129ca-8a2b-5a4f-8600-d7fd45c7c512" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186124888 #edb/ref 1074 "The level curves for the function $f(x,y)$ are given by the equations \n\n$$\nf(x,y)=c.\n$$\n\nNotice that the range of $f(x,y)$ is $[0,\\infty ).$ So, we will consider only level curves for $c\\ge 0.$\n\nTherefore, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & =c \\\\ \\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & =c \\\\ {x}^{2}+{y}^{2} & ={c}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation above gives us a family of circles centered at the origin. Therefore, the correct graph is as follows:\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\n![](images/41/413a11a52ed6a4fc76c2848867d664a63fce24dd39088cdd5826b576d8e7b09c.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125326 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186125456 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125326 #edb/ref 1061 15418 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125326 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "76440382-82ba-5d62-8fa4-df79b4f447e7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125326 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186125753 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125327 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186125328 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125327 #edb/ref 1061 15419 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125327 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "5630589a-ec0b-5b7d-9643-ba6b2dadf69d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125327 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186124475 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125328 #edb/ref 1061 15420 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125328 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "41eaaf34-192a-5179-a455-5ee546c5e672" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125328 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186124476 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125456 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186125327 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125456 #edb/ref 1061 22187 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125456 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c173f9a1-f861-58bd-a38c-880ac35a93c6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125456 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186124553 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125753 #edb/ref 1064 "Suppose we want to find the intersection of the surface $z = f(x,y) = x^2 + y^2$ with the plane $z=4.$\n\nTo find the intersection, we set both equations equal to each other:\n\n$$\nx^2 + y^2 = 4\n$$\n\nGraphing the above equation in the $xy$-plane, we get a circle $\\color{black} C$ with center at $(0,0)$ and radius $2.$\n\n![](images/c3/c32f35ccd2c0eb01732194ac419fa328f62f1281c8bf4fb5ccc75218153c46d5.png)\n\nThe curve  $\\color{black} C$ is called a **level curve** of the surface $z = x^2 + y^2.$ The level curves of the form\n\n$$\nx^2 + y^2 = c\n$$\n\nfor $c=1,2,3,4$ are shown in the diagram below.\n\n![](images/6c/6c86604edc24e92fe51a8eed55386d8b01531b4a4f025e70f7ff33caf0c5df81.png)\n\nThe diagram above is called a **contour plot.** The level curves are sometimes called **contours.**\n\nIn general, a **level curve** $L_{c}(f)$ of a real-valued function of two variables $f(x,y)$ is any set of the form\n\n \n\n$$\nL_{c}(f) = \\left\\{(x,y) \\, : \\,f(x,y)=c\\right\\}\n$$\n\nwhere $c$ is a constant.\n\n**Note:** In our example, $x^2 +y^2 \\ge 0$ for all $(x,y),$ which means that the sets $L_{c}(f)$ are nonempty for $c \\ge 0.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125753 #edb/ref 1065 2876 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125753 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "3a86e054-2c30-5b05-8ec7-9293b3a78aa8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186125753 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260146 #edb/ref 1080 "images/b7/b79c75fb4de77313ff9ae17938eeabc8b55cca395e6516c09abf6742f9b6a23b.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260146 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260146 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1f81b229-411e-50ec-868a-e71357c6d344" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260294 #edb/ref 1080 "images/01/0162f31b5dbb35c6d370dff9b54257708df39b6957f6547059842cd31769669b.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260294 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260294 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2e72b69e-de1d-539b-bd7f-b17ba3bb78bc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260656 #edb/ref 1080 "images/ef/ef27f12eb1ee6872210bf8cadb6908efd31c1bb54e9e7d34cc3456df2ee03a77.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260656 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260656 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5b8f524a-9681-5a5a-aa6a-8d21d370c6a6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260967 #edb/ref 1080 "images/b4/b4642ea9b585ac066f2ed904b1bee4df7d1ff3449ba2d09afca8364b58f1dcba.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260967 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186260967 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7d7ac9b2-3db3-5b9c-a04a-a8589af15779" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261045 #edb/ref 1080 "images/7a/7afff53b46a661fc6e0df4df871810dc5514ff7b476294e76c70f60d4e1643f9.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261045 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261045 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "867c8bfd-8db7-54f2-837f-8096fc36058e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261134 #edb/ref 1080 "images/67/67e9cfee7779fdde389a0804e7f52372ca9434de56b6611d296d4ac9c0759f72.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261134 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261134 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "90a9daad-d37b-5bdf-8f0c-1e578a2870e2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261280 #edb/ref 1080 "images/2c/2c570cc9958db69a30dc400920b6ff27574e79bd26a53b35e086cb03034c5b6d.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261280 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261280 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a19c1461-ef0c-529e-9726-029d4c772ce7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261560 #edb/ref 1080 "images/f8/f82efe38e48f39aee18cf9e00cdd69f07c37cc414b08b5bc78ebc0a876c02d7e.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261560 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261560 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bebf2ce8-badd-5f41-86c5-5e5bb4040e73" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261596 #edb/ref 1080 "images/cd/cdd8cec2d30ff2956d5210a49036c17d99781d0b62c0b0f42f97d0575c4d80f6.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261596 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261596 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c30db028-ad8b-5802-9d7d-fe2ee0d636d7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261746 #edb/ref 1080 "images/d7/d774c444ad33c68ec5d507611324030f2005671265ba5f855f322d8db57b69b4.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261746 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186261746 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d4894fee-b5e1-59e2-86ca-ba516e7266bf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262158 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186260146 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262158 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186260294 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262158 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186260967 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262158 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186261045 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262158 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186261560 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262158 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262158 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262158 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186261045 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262158 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "12e3878f-62b0-500f-bf38-893dbf70a32f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262388 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186260656 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262388 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186261134 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262388 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186261280 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262388 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186261596 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262388 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186261746 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262388 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262388 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262388 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186261596 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262388 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "93f1dce4-27ec-501b-8cb3-8ca95b44d739" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262935 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186449194 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186262935 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186449195 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186262935 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186449196 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186262935 #edb/ref 1069 "q-129063" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262935 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262935 #edb/ref 1071 "The level curves of the function $f(x,y)=\\frac{y}{x}$ are given by $f(x,y)=c.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $c=-1$ gives a hyperbola\n- **II.** $c=0$ gives the $y$-axis, excluding the origin\n- **III.** $c=1$ gives the line $y=x,$ excluding the origin" #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186262935 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "42b1c0f3-5dd1-53b2-92c2-3218b1cbc331" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186262935 #edb/ref 1074 "Setting $f(x,y)=c$ gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{y}{x} & =c \\\\ y & =cx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore:\n\n- If $c=-1,$ the level curve is the line $y=-x,$ excluding the origin. So, I is false.\n\n- If $c=0,$ the level curve is the line $y=0,$ which is the $x$-axis (excluding the origin). So, II is false.\n\n- If $c=1,$ the level curve is the line $y=x,$ excluding the origin. So, III is true.\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"III only\"." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186321510 #edb/ref 1080 "images/7c/7c4530dc74747fc0bdae0ca4c8608a72dbf03ca413d4479c8a4b9224246ac01f.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186321510 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186321510 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2eeacf93-e554-58a5-b0b0-b69b6c92cd8e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186321935 #edb/ref 1080 "images/b4/b4642ea9b585ac066f2ed904b1bee4df7d1ff3449ba2d09afca8364b58f1dcba.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186321935 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186321935 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "65ab1147-95f7-57c6-a0f6-195188d68f77" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186321994 #edb/ref 1080 "images/ae/ae78f21487e5883b278f0b62a92b2b44ffe8e83e9bd942cf6c94ed4c46d18c67.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186321994 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186321994 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6ceac803-4898-591d-8209-d1d92026603a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186322239 #edb/ref 1080 "images/22/22ff469fae1e93c0d805e7443c110c8c56b4f005b0ce2f4a641f19a23dfa3135.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186322239 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186322239 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "88bcb675-5baf-5bc6-9fec-a149e6d8836e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323153 #edb/ref 1080 "images/e4/e49f976cd92eac7780062c7013a29e6acb737d4496a1b61955d7c2ceac96084a.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323153 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323153 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "fe7b2229-4ac4-5665-affc-5be5302d12bb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323552 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186321510 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323552 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186321935 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323552 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186321994 #edb/re